<SRF>26 27 14.00 20</SRF> ELECTRICITY METERING or <SRF>26 27 13.10 30</SRF> ELECTRIC METERS for metering details, which are available 
in metric (SI) and U.S. Customary (IP) system dimension.  Use these files to develop project specific drawings, 
including:</NPR><BRK/>
