]<SPT><TTL>CAST-IN-PLACE CONCRETE</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Use the first bracketed paragraph when project includes a concrete section in Division 03; otherwise, the 
