<OLI>Composed of fine aggregate, coarse aggregate, portland cement, and water so proportioned and mixed as to produce a plastic, workable mixture.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Fine aggregate:  hard, dense, durable, clean, and uncoated sand.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Coarse aggregate:  reasonably well graded from<MET> 4.75 mm to 25 mm</MET><ENG> 3/16 inch to 1 inch</ENG>.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Fine and coarse aggregates:  free from injurious amounts of dirt, vegetable matter, soft fragments or other deleterious substances.</OLI><BRK/>
